sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SC as Face<br/>scanner
  participant R as access<br/>router
  participant BA as :ScannerCheck<br/>InService
  participant AS as :Access<br/>Service
  participant P as :VipArea<br/>Policy
  participant ZO as :Zone<br/>Occupancy
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Note over SC: matches face
  SC->>+R: POST /access/device-check-in<br/>templateId, confidence, X-Device-Key
  R->>R: zone from device key
  break unknown key
    R-->>SC: 401
  end
  R->>+BA: checkIn(session, request, scanner)
  alt confidence < 0.80 or unknown template
    BA->>DB: add DeniedAccessAttempt
    BA-->>R: AppError(403)
    R->>DB: commit
    R-->>SC: 403
  end
  BA->>DB: find MemberProfile by templateId
  BA->>+AS: checkIn(memberId, zone)
  AS->>DB: load User (refused if disabled)
  AS->>+P: check(memberId, zone)
  P->>DB: VIP entitlement in plan?
  P->>+ZO: enter(zone, memberId,<br/>stay, capacity)
  ZO->>ZO: Redis Lua script<br/>(one atomic step)
  ZO-->>-P: ADMITTED or<br/>WAITLISTED(n)
  alt not entitled, disabled or room full
    P-->>AS: AppError(403) / AppError(409, n)
    AS-->>BA: error
    BA->>DB: add DeniedAccessAttempt
    BA-->>R: AppError(403 or 409)
    R->>DB: commit
    R-->>SC: 403, or 409 with waiting-list number n
  end
  P-->>-AS: tookNewPlace
  AS->>DB: add AccessLog
  AS-->>-BA: CheckInResult
  BA-->>-R: CheckInResult
  R->>DB: commit
  opt commit fails
    R->>ZO: releasePlace(memberId, zone)
  end
  R-->>-SC: 201 granted
  Note over BA,ZO: Gym floor: GymFloorPolicy, no capacity limit.<br/>Planned: booking checks for studio, pool, stations.
